Conclusion  
─────────────────────────────  
This goal model provides a structured, hierarchical decomposition of the mission into goals and tasks. The use of sequential (“;”), parallel (“#”), and fallback (“FALLBACK(… )”) execution annotations reflects the mission’s operational requirements—ensuring that both phases (collection and delivery) are completed reliably while allowing for alternative execution paths in case of low battery or when multiple resources are involved.

